module bankr-tnw-local-rules.local-rules

import core.frbp9006.{ frbp9006 }
import frbp.events.{ FirstMeetingDate, PetitionFiled }

// The Bankr. W.D. Tenn. court's own periods and page limit, counted under
// FRBP 9006(a), the FRCP 6(a) method: the Local Rules effective September
// 24, 2026, which already include TNWB LBR 2016-1 and 3011-1 as adopted by
// General Order 26-0002 effective the same day (the order and the two new
// rules are vendored separately and their text matches the consolidation),
// so there is one layer. The FRBP periods (schedules, claims, the chapter
// 13 plan, discharge, dischargeability, exemptions, the adversary answer,
// appeals, including the 14-day appeal of an order on unclaimed funds, TNWB
// LBR 3011-1) are lit/frbp's and are not declared again. Stated in the
// rules but not declared: calendar-day deadlines (each later monthly
// operating report by the 15th of the following month, 2081-1(c),
// 2082-1(a)(3), 2083-1(a)(2)); hearing settings the Courtroom Deputy fixes
// (objection dates in chapters 7, 11 and 12, 9013-1(b); a chapter 13
// hearing on not less than 21 days' notice, 9013-1(c)); the mediator's own
// scheduling on not less than 21 days' notice (9019-1(d)(2)); the ten days
// counsel give opposing parties to approve an order before certifying
// (9074-1(e)(2)), a condition on the certificate; the three business days
// of that certificate; and an extension motion for the final decree due
// within the same 60 days as the motion (2081-1(k)(2)(C)).
/// A memorandum in an adversary proceeding, without prior approval of the
/// court (TNWB LBR 7016-1(a)).
limit adversary-memorandum { pages <= 25 cite "TNWB LBR 7016-1(a)" } cite "TNWB LBR 7016-1(a)"

/// The Order Approving Disclosure Statement, with notice of the
/// confirmation hearing, is entered (TNWB LBR 2081-1(g)).
event DisclosureStatementApproved()
/// The original chapter 11 confirmation hearing is scheduled to be held
/// (TNWB LBR 2081-1(i)).
event Chapter11ConfirmationHearingScheduled()
/// The court rules that a chapter 11 plan may be confirmed (TNWB LBR
/// 2081-1(j)(2)).
event ConfirmationRuling()
/// The order confirming a chapter 11 plan is entered (TNWB LBR
/// 2081-1(k)(1)).
event Chapter11PlanConfirmed()
/// A chapter 11 plan is substantially consummated, § 1101(2), or an
/// individual chapter 11 debtor completes all plan payments (TNWB LBR
/// 2081-1(k)(2)).
event SubstantialConsummation()
/// A chapter 12 debtor files a tax return due during the case with the
/// taxing authority (TNWB LBR 2082-1(d)).
event Chapter12ReturnFiled()
/// The chapter 13 confirmation hearing is scheduled to be held (TNWB LBR
/// 2083-1(b)).
event Chapter13ConfirmationHearingScheduled()
/// An Application for Payment of Unclaimed Funds is filed and served (TNWB
/// LBR 3011-1).
event UnclaimedFundsApplicationServed()
/// A motion for an order that no stay is in effect under §§ 362(b) or
/// 362(c)(4) is served (TNWB LBR 4001-2).
event NoStayMotionServed()
/// A hearing at which a memorandum citing an opinion not on Westlaw or
/// Lexis is used is scheduled to be held (TNWB LBR 7016-1(b)).
event AdversaryHearingScheduled()
/// The parties report to the mediator an agreement in principle reached
/// after assignment to mediation (TNWB LBR 9019-1(d)).
event AgreementInPrincipleReported()
/// A contested matter or adversary proceeding is finally determined (TNWB
/// LBR 9072-1).
event ExhibitMatterDetermined()
/// The chapter 12 or 13 trustee receives a proposed order for signature
/// (TNWB LBR 9074-1(b)).
event TrusteeReceivedProposedOrder()
/// The court announces an oral ruling and directs a party to prepare a
/// proposed order (TNWB LBR 9074-1(c)).
event BenchRulingAnnounced()
/// A memorandum is filed in an adversary proceeding (TNWB LBR 7016-1(a)).
event AdversaryMemorandumFiled() paper adversary-memorandum

/// TNWB LBR 2081-1(c): unless the court orders otherwise, the first chapter
/// 11 monthly financial report is filed 30 days after the case is
/// commenced.
deadline chapter11-first-report-period: 30.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2081-1(c)"
/// TNWB LBR 2081-1(g): within 7 days after entry of the Order Approving
/// Disclosure Statement, the plan proponent sends the ballot with the plan,
/// disclosure statement and order.
deadline ballot-mailing-period: 7.days after DisclosureStatementApproved() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2081-1(g)"
/// TNWB LBR 2081-1(i): not less than 7 days before the original
/// confirmation hearing, the plan proponent files and serves the tally of
/// ballots (Local Form 019F).
deadline ballot-tally-period: 7.days before Chapter11ConfirmationHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2081-1(i)"
/// TNWB LBR 2081-1(j)(2): within 14 days of the court's ruling that the
/// plan may be confirmed, the proponent prepares and presents the
/// confirmation order.
deadline confirmation-order-period: 14.days after ConfirmationRuling() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2081-1(j)"
/// TNWB LBR 2081-1(k)(1): within 60 days after entry of the confirmation
/// order or such other date as the court sets, the plan proponent files and
/// serves the Final Report (Local Form 015F).
deadline chapter11-final-report-period: 60.days after Chapter11PlanConfirmed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2081-1(k)"
/// TNWB LBR 2081-1(k)(2)(A): within 60 days after substantial consummation
/// (or, for an individual debtor, completion of plan payments), the plan
/// proponent files a Motion for Final Decree or a statement why it is
/// premature.
deadline final-decree-motion-period: 60.days after SubstantialConsummation() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2081-1(k)"
/// TNWB LBR 2082-1(a)(3): unless the court orders otherwise, the first
/// chapter 12 monthly financial report is filed 30 days after the case is
/// commenced.
deadline chapter12-first-report-period: 30.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2082-1(a)"
/// TNWB LBR 2082-1(b): the completed summary is delivered to the chapter 12
/// trustee and the United States Trustee at least 7 days before the first
/// setting of the meeting of creditors.
deadline chapter12-summary-period: 7.days before FirstMeetingDate() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2082-1(b)"
/// TNWB LBR 2082-1(c): within 14 days after commencement of the case, the
/// chapter 12 debtor provides the trustee and the United States Trustee
/// evidence of fire and extended coverage.
deadline chapter12-insurance-period: 14.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2082-1(c)"
/// TNWB LBR 2082-1(d): the chapter 12 debtor provides the trustee and the
/// United States Trustee a copy of each tax return due during the case
/// within 14 days after it is filed.
deadline chapter12-tax-return-period: 14.days after Chapter12ReturnFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2082-1(d)"
/// TNWB LBR 2083-1(a)(2): unless the court orders otherwise, the first
/// chapter 13 business debtor's monthly report is filed 30 days after the
/// case is commenced.
deadline chapter13-first-report-period: 30.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2083-1(a)(2)"
/// TNWB LBR 2083-1(b)(2): a written objection to confirmation of a chapter
/// 13 plan is filed and served 7 days before the confirmation hearing, or
/// may be deemed waived.
deadline chapter13-confirmation-objection-period: 7.days before Chapter13ConfirmationHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 2083-1(b)(2)"
/// TNWB LBR 3011-1: an objection to an Application for Payment of Unclaimed
/// Funds is filed and served within 21 days after its filing and service;
/// absent objection the court may order payment.
deadline unclaimed-funds-objection-period: 21.days after UnclaimedFundsApplicationServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 3011-1"
/// TNWB LBR 4001-2: an order that no stay is in effect may be signed
/// without a hearing 14 days after service of the motion if no party in
/// interest objects.
deadline no-stay-objection-period: 14.days after NoStayMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 4001-2"
/// TNWB LBR 7016-1(b): counsel attaches, or provides the court, a copy of a
/// cited opinion not available on Westlaw or Lexis at least 7 days before
/// the hearing.
deadline cited-opinion-copy-period: 7.days before AdversaryHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 7016-1(b)"
/// TNWB LBR 9019-1(d): as soon as practicable but no later than 30 days
/// after reporting an agreement in principle, the parties confirm to the
/// mediator that the settlement is finalized, or the mediation conference
/// goes forward.
deadline settlement-finalization-period: 30.days after AgreementInPrincipleReported() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 9019-1(d)"
/// TNWB LBR 9072-1: after final determination of a contested matter or
/// adversary proceeding, counsel have 30 days to withdraw exhibits.
deadline exhibit-withdrawal-period: 30.days after ExhibitMatterDetermined() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 9072-1"
/// TNWB LBR 9074-1(b)(1)-(2): the chapter 12 or 13 trustee approves or
/// disapproves a proposed order within 7 days after receipt.
deadline trustee-order-review-period: 7.days after TrusteeReceivedProposedOrder() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 9074-1(b)"
/// TNWB LBR 9074-1(c): the approved proposed order on a bench ruling is
/// presented to the court not more than 10 days after the ruling.
deadline bench-ruling-order-period: 10.days after BenchRulingAnnounced() counted_by frbp9006 cite "TNWB LBR 9074-1(c)"
